---
subject: Your Detag account deletion was requested

--- text ---
Hi,

You asked to delete your Detag account. Your account is scheduled for deletion in 30 days — until then you can sign in to cancel the request and keep your account.

After the 30 days your account, sessions and jobs are permanently deleted. Audit records are kept as required by law.

— The Detag team

